## My Analyst Role Takeaway

As a Tier 1 SOC analyst, my responsibility is to monitor security alerts, investigate suspicious activity using available tools, document findings, and escalate incidents to Tier 2 when they exceed my authority or expertise. I should collect relevant evidence and follow established procedures rather than independently making remediation decisions or modifying production systems.

